    <p><strong>Start with a 14-day free trial.</strong></p>
    <p>
      For the first 20 customers, or until 31 Jan 2027, whichever comes first, the founding-customer price, in US or Australian dollars, is <strong>US$29 per month</strong>, or <strong>A$45 per month including GST in Australia</strong>, for the first 12 months. After those 12 months it is <strong>US$49 per month</strong>, or <strong>A$75 per month including GST in Australia</strong>. A short feedback questionnaire is requested, about two weeks after you start. The founding price is not withdrawn if you don&rsquo;t fill it in. Giving a quote is optional.
