    <p>The founding price covers your first 12 months after the trial. Then the normal monthly price applies. Monthly subscription. Cancel any time. No lock-in contract.</p>
    <p>
      <strong>How the free trial works.</strong>
      You enter your card at checkout, but you aren&rsquo;t charged anything for 14 days. Cancel before the trial ends and you pay nothing. If you keep going, your first monthly payment is taken when the trial ends, then on the same date each month. At the founding price, that payment is US$29, or A$45 including GST in Australia, and the next payments stay at that founding price until 12 months of founding price are done, then US$49 a month, or A$75 a month including GST in Australia. This is Paddle&rsquo;s standard free trial: a card is taken at checkout, and nothing is charged during the 14 days. One trial per customer.
